WEBVTT

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.090
Fire them arrows!

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.020
Chuck them smoke bombs! Plop!

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.600
What the--

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:24.060
--Huh?!
--Smoke?

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.190
Smoke!

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:31.900
Hey! What are you doing out here?!

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.530
There's a fire! They set it on fire again!

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:38.030
No, they didn't--it's the ground
behind us that's burning!

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:40.240
But it's nothing but smoke in there!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.500
Huh?

00:00:57.180 --> 00:01:00.640
Now, then... let's get this started.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:11.150
What? You're going down there?

00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:12.570
That's right.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:14.190
Boss!

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.780
The planks are in place!

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.370
Get pullin' on those horses!

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:21.740
The siege tower's been cleared out!

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:23.120
Let's go!

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.750
If you wanna come with,
Zhang Tang, you better change first.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:34.010
Are you lot thinking straight?

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:39.680
There are 150,000 troops below,
Wei and Han both!

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:43.310
And you're going down there?

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:48.480
You'd be leaping into a veritable
sea of enemy combatants.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.320
Wha-- The enemy?!

00:02:02.530 --> 00:02:04.240
You got <i>that </i>right.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.210
Th-They just... started fighting?

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:09.500
No...

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.880
Take their flags!

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.880
Do <i>not </i>engage!

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:13.960
Let's go!

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.380
A-A charge? So few of us--
against 10,000 of them?

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.300
We're going, too!

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.850
Zhang Tang, sir!

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:23.810
Oh?

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:28.020
Old Zhang Tang's changed into
Wei armor--he's joinin' the party!

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:33.980
That Qin armor <i>did </i>stick out
like a sore thumb.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.610
All right! We're past all that mess!

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:42.120
This'll be a <i>cinch</i>!

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.950
Not so fast.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:48.870
The smoke bombs threw the base
of the siege tower into chaos.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.830
The <i>real </i>fight...

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.040
...starts now!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.960
Wh-Whoa! Are we riding into <i>that</i>?

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.340
Don't you fret, Lei Tu.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:05.470
It'll all go just fine.

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:14.610
Holy moly! Look at all them people!

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:15.940
Raise your shields!

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:19.610
Ain't nothin' lamer than
dyin' to a Qin arrow!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.240
At this point, the Wei and Han
main camps were unaware

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:30.290
that Huan Yi's unit had
descended to the ground.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:33.330
Our troops have scaled the wall, too!

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.800
Their attention was focused
on the top of Hangu Pass,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.420
--as it became an ever more
critical battleground.
--Fire! Loose those arrows!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.470
Give them backup up there!

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.760
Huan Yi had seen this coming.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.390
"Wei"

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:47.390
He approached this great sea of foes

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.930
and crossed it in style.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:24.490
"A General's Pride"

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:31.950
Keep up, archers! Aim those things right!

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.370
Th-This is too much!

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.000
Zhang Tang, sir, is this--

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:41.340
That Huan Yi. What a man.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:46.180
Slipping in among the enemy
is not itself unusual.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.010
Entire smaller units have done so.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:53.970
The larger the enemy army
and the greater the confusion,

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.270
the better your chances.

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:59.650
It all makes perfect sense.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:00.690
And yet...

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:07.150
To do it now, facing a combined
Wei-Han army of 150,000?

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:11.280
What daring--what a strategic eye!

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:14.490
No slacking! Fire those arrows!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:20.460
Extraordinary. I've never seen
a man fight like this.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:27.930
Huan Yi's talent may well be on
a par with that of the Six Greats.

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:31.050
Ridiculous.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:34.720
Wipe out every last one
of those Qin bastards!

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:41.270
The might of one of the Six Greats...
within this impudent fool?

00:06:41.270 --> 00:06:43.150
"Han"

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:44.900
Zhang Tang, sir!

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:47.280
Isn't this direction... no, it can't be!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:52.700
Hold, Huan Yi.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:53.530
Eh?

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:56.040
What will you do down there?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.540
What is your goal?

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:04.460
The tide's turned in their favor.
This is serious stuff.

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:05.750
If we don't want to be pulled under,

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:09.380
we need to do something big, too--
and fast.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:11.180
Something big?

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:17.350
What else?
I'm talkin' about something <i>big</i>.

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:23.560
A general's head, eh?

00:07:23.560 --> 00:07:29.070
At first I thought he was going
after the Wei general, but no.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.030
What Huan Yi wants

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.580
is the head of Cheng Hui,
commanding general of Han!

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:40.790
Damn that Huan Yi.
He saw it all from atop Hangu Pass.

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:47.130
The Han army's main camp is much
further out compared to the Wei army's.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:50.170
Hence this clever scheme.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:56.470
We're turning! Are we headed
straight for Han's HQ?

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:59.930
But the closer we get, the further
we are from Hangu Pass's arrows.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:02.230
They'll be getting suspicious soon!

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:06.360
No, this entire archery unit
can make it through.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:10.900
That's how much the enemy is
focused on the top of Hangu Pass.

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.150
Y-You mean...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:16.030
The real question is what happens next.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:21.580
No matter how well we blend in,
it still all comes down to military might.

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:25.790
Storming the main camp
with 80 cavalry is difficult.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:29.590
With 500--or 400 at a minimum--

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.970
Zh-Zhang Tang, sir! What is <i>that</i>?

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.930
A detached force!

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:40.850
That Huan Yi, splitting up his
unit to stay inconspicuous...

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.680
--And over there!
--There, too!

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:45.100
--There's another!
--Five in all!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:47.270
Is--

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:49.270
Is that <i>400</i>?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.070
"Hangu Pass: The Huan Yi Army's Post"

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.070
--Kill 'em!
--Go!

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.400
"Hangu Pass: The Huan Yi Army's Post"

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.400
--Shut 'em down!
--Push on past!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.280
Stay where you are, damn you!

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:58.910
We hold firm till the bossman gets back!

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.720
Po--

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.010
Poison arrows!

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:20.890
Our black bow brigade seems
to have reached the top.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:24.180
Excellent! Now it's only a matter of time!

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:25.600
Outstanding!

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.020
And they said our warpower was lacking.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.730
Let's prove those other armies wrong!

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.280
Urgent report!

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.190
Urgent report!

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.160
A Wei unit is coming right for us!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:38.660
Really?

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:40.580
Any word from the Wei army?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.330
I-I don't know.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.660
It seemed suspicious,
so we tried to stop them.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.120
But they fought back--and broke through!

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:50.540
What? Wei soldiers and
Han soldiers, fighting?

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.460
S-Save the details for later!

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.510
What's important is that those
Wei soldiers are almost here!

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:03.310
"Huan Yi's Unit (400 Troops)"

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:07.440
Huan Yi, we're headed for battle!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:11.520
Split the unit into three and
deploy left and right flanks!

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.980
I'll command the middle.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.700
You join either side!

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:22.830
You think you can take the middle?
With <i>that </i>dead man's mug?

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:24.240
Don't underestimate me,

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:26.160
you brat!

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:34.050
<i>My </i>army has been doing battle
since King Zhao's reign.

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:38.840
We are a hundred times mightier
than you ex-bandits!

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.970
Wh-What on earth is that?!

00:10:40.970 --> 00:10:42.470
We have to stop them!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:47.560
Anyone who turns a weapon
on this camp is an enemy.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:50.350
Kill them all--no mercy.

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.440
Sir!

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:52.650
Increase the ranks!

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:54.360
Call back the reserves!

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.490
"Hangu Pass: Meng Ao's Post"

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:57.690
Wh-What?!

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:01.570
Huan Yi and Zhang Tang
have joined the fray?

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:08.620
They request that you move to the
central watchtower to take command.

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.040
But how?

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.880
We have our hands full as it is!

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:19.420
Zhang Tang must know
how reckless his request is.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.680
He must be prepared not to return.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.680
Poison?

00:11:26.680 --> 00:11:31.310
I'd heard that Zhang Tang's
main camp had been hit with poison

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.270
some days ago...

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.650
Could he be done for?

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:43.820
So Zhang Tang is looking
to die on the battlefield.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:51.540
Very well! I shall move to
the center and take command!

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:53.170
M-Meng Ao, sir!

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:04.890
Holy hell! What is <i>with </i>that old fart?!

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:06.640
And everyone around him!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:10.390
Who knew Zhang Tang's
army was this powerful?

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:14.230
Y-Yeah, but didn't Han poison him?

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:17.070
I thought he couldn't
even stand up by himself!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.660
A-Are you thinking straight,
Zheng Tang, sir?

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:26.620
Going down there with
no more than 30, 40 cavalry...

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:28.910
What about our post here?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.460
It doesn't much matter if I stay.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:35.460
Either way, I won't be around much longer.

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.920
Zh-Zhang Tang...

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.210
But that's...

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:47.550
I've asked old Bai Lao to take
command of Hangu Pass.

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:52.350
You're more than capable
of taking it from there.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:58.360
Again and again, you've overcome
so much adversity in all these years.

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.280
You have what it takes.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:08.870
Until Huan Yi arrived, I thought
I'd end up dying right here.

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.870
But that man...

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:16.830
He struck out into this vast sea,
right before my eyes.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:18.590
He may be vulgar rabble...

00:13:21.340 --> 00:13:23.880
...but he is a brave, brave man.

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:31.310
Apologies, but I will decide where I die.

00:13:31.310 --> 00:13:35.100
My one last selfishness. Forgive me.

00:13:35.100 --> 00:13:39.860
I have been proud to
fight alongside you all!

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:41.480
Zhang Tang!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:47.320
All right! We can break through here, too!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:50.030
Are these guys pushovers or what?!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:54.120
Of course! Han hasn't seen
the battles we've seen.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.330
Take them seriously!

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.380
Well, don't get <i>mad</i>.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:14:00.340
The enemy's main camp!

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:04.460
We've made it to the 8th station!
We can ride right in!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.760
All right!

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:12.220
Zhang Tang! Zhang Tang, sir!

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:13.520
Zhang Tang!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:16.640
I-Is that...

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.310
Han's cavalry?!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:24.990
B-But compared to those earlier troops...

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:31.780
"Chief of Defense, Han Army Main Camp"
"Nai Gun"

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:31.780
I don't know who you are, but don't
get ahead of yourselves, you fools.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:34.870
The main camp defense squad, eh?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.750
Don't falter! Get in there!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.060
Not yet, body of mine.

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.230
Not just yet.

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:07.030
The pain is of no importance.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:14.740
Grant strength to the arms
that wield my glaive.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:20.920
Dammit! We... we were so close...

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.710
We've crushed the enemy!

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:27.130
Leave it to Nai Gun!

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:31.550
Ch-Cheng Hui, sir!

00:15:31.550 --> 00:15:33.640
The enemies from both flanks

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.600
have circled around to the rear!

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.180
They <i>what</i>?!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:49.900
Cheng Hui had quickly moved his
own unit in the opposite direction.

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:53.620
He must have realized those two
units were the foe's true muscle!

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.780
That's our Cheng Hui!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:16:00.460
There was only one error
in Cheng Hui's judgment.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.540
And that was...

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:06.920
The main camp's flag!
Han's main camp is headed our way!

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:22.060
The Zhang Tang unit he'd believed
destroyed had caught its second wind.

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:31.530
Cheng Hui, sir, fall back!

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.570
We finally made it, boys!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:36.740
Zhang Tang, sir!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:37.870
Zhang Tang?!

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:40.000
You mean, the Qin general?

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:44.170
The enemies at the rear are closing in!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:49.000
There's still some of the defense
squad left! This is more important!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:55.010
I joined my first campaign
at the age of 15.

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:57.180
Another 50 years have passed.

00:16:57.180 --> 00:17:01.180
My glaive and I have
crossed many a battlefield,

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:05.060
drenched in mud and blood.

00:17:05.060 --> 00:17:08.070
Now I am one of Qin's elder generals,

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:13.530
the one with the most
battles under his belt.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:18.330
Not a bad journey, if I do say so myself.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:20.040
And now...

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:24.750
I must decide how best to mark its end.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:28.880
I don't mind dying on the battlefield.

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:32.630
Just... not by poison.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:37.050
It... it can't be by poison.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:41.560
This is no way for a general to die!

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.730
Die, Zhang Tang!

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.770
What have you done to me?!

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.360
You absolute scoundrels!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.860
After General Zhang Tang!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:02.870
What nonsense.

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:08.130
Poison is a respectable
weapon for efficient killing.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:14.380
No decrepit old man's tired
warrior-logic will change that.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.890
Zhang Tang, sir!

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.930
Cheng Hui, sir, let's hurry to the left.

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.600
There are more enemies behind!

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:26.310
I am aware.

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:29.980
To think that man still lives...

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:33.360
--Perhaps I'll dissect him
once things quiet down.
--Stop them!

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.940
Drop dead!

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:43.490
This is absurd!
Why hasn't the poison killed him?!

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.370
You just don't understand, Cheng Hui!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.960
But then again, how <i>could </i>you?

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:52.750
Too busy playing around
with stopgap poisons

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:56.340
to fight with your own two hands!

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.970
Go!

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.800
Zhang Tang, sir!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.050
You could never understand

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:05.350
the might of a man--of a <i>general</i>!

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.150
You imbecile!

00:19:13.820 --> 00:19:17.820
A great general would
<i>never </i>turn tail and run!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.670
He did it!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:36.210
Zhang Tang has killed Han
commanding general Cheng Hui!

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:38.380
G-General Cheng Hui...

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:39.720
It can't be...

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:43.800
--All right! A general's head!
--Superbly done, Zhang Tang, sir.

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:47.980
Don't die on me yet, old man.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:51.940
You promised me a groveling, remember.

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:57.480
Huan Yi...

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.440
--Avenge General Cheng Hui! Kill them!
--I'd love to follow up on that,

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.740
--Avenge General Cheng Hui! Kill them!
--but I ain't got the time.

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:04.410
All right, gang! Move out!

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:07.580
Wait.

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:14.000
You... you haven't answered my question.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:14.880
Eh?

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:20.010
Why are you fighting... as a Qin general?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.720
What are you doing, boss? We gotta hurry!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:28.850
I don't think you
understand the situation!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:33.400
If you won't answer, I'll answer for you:

00:20:33.400 --> 00:20:38.360
You... you find war <i>entertaining</i>.

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:44.740
You live for the rush of winning
a battle with your own might.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:46.910
And <i>that</i>...

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:52.160
<i>That </i>is what makes a renowned general.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:57.340
I hate to say it... but you...
you have talent, too.

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:02.630
I won't grovel,

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:05.470
but promise me this:

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:12.020
Become the best general in Qin, Huan Yi!

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:20.030
Qin... is in your hands!

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:32.450
You can sleep talk
when you're dead, old man.

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:38.710
Stubborn... bastard...

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:40.710
Zhang Tang!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:45.880
Tch.

00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:48.350
You sure did drive me up a wall, old man.

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:51.140
"Qin army general
Zhang Tang dies in battle"

00:21:48.350 --> 00:21:51.140
You sure did drive me up a wall, old man.

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:55.140
Ch-Cheng Hui!

00:21:55.140 --> 00:21:59.230
How-- How can you be in this state?

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:03.820
The enemy! Where has the enemy gone?!

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:04.900
However...

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:08.820
There was indeed a price
to pay for Cheng Hui's head.

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:11.740
The Huan Yi army post
on the right of Hangu Pass

00:22:11.740 --> 00:22:14.250
had been heavily invaded,

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:19.000
the three-story watchtower
now engulfed in flame.

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.960
Open the gate from inside!

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:26.970
The enemy's using the righthand staircase!

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:29.600
Muster the reserves below on the right!

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:30.970
Yes, sir!

00:22:30.970 --> 00:22:32.970
Will it hold?

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:34.140
What?!

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:37.140
The Han general Cheng Hui's been slain?

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:39.060
He's been killed?

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:41.360
What the hell happened?

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:45.320
Well, ah... there are several
conflicting reports...

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.950
He was killed by Wei troops,

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:50.240
or by the Qin generals
Zhang Tang and Huan Yi...

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:53.540
Li Mu.

00:22:53.540 --> 00:22:57.210
If this news is true, this was
one of Huan Yi's schemes.

00:22:57.210 --> 00:23:03.130
He did much the same in Shanyang
with his surprise attack on Bai Guixi.

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:07.010
So he killed one of the five
coalition army generals, then,

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:09.680
this former bandit?

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:15.100
Hangu Pass is hanging on by a thread.

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:18.520
Even if Cheng Hui really has been slain,

00:23:18.520 --> 00:23:20.980
their plight remains unchanged.

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:58.620
Next time on <i>Kingdom</i>:
"The Wa Lin Army's Charge."
